# D-105 native (steps/d105-native.md §4; the author's Q39: "сначала в интерпретаторе и потом нативно"): an admitted
# formal passed on, as it is, to another Model formal: `rd2 (Model: m)` hands its m to `rd`.  The value
# already has its record (o, Model); rd's formal is marked through the edge rd2 -> rd, and reads 10.
# Success is 7.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
fn: rd (Model: m) size_t
return: m\a
fn: rd2 (Model: m) size_t
return: rd(m)
fn: go () size_t
    Other: o
    return: rd2(o)
size_t: got 0U
got: go()
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
if: got = 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
